'''Frostbird '''is a [[Pets|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtained by purchasing the final [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Christmas_Event_2018#Lumber_Yard tier] of the [[Christmas Event 2018]] Lumber Yard. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.  

== Appearance ==
The [[Frostbird]] is a reskin of [[Phoenix]], but instead of it being yellow and orange, it's different shades of blue. It also carries a trail of blue when flying.
== Trivia ==

* This is one of three phoenix pets in [[Murder Mystery 2]], The other two phoenix pets are [[Phoenix]] and [[Ice Phoenix]].
* This pet was obtained in the "Lumber Yard", a special tier list that is only during exclusive events like for Christmas or Halloween.
* The pet is a retextured version of the [[Phoenix]] that came in the [[8-Bit Item Pack]].

